  "published": "2026-02-05T05:31:17.82Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "**Opencode tool output format**: Tools now output in struct/map format with boolean values (e.g., `bash: true`, `write: false`) instead of list format; **Opencode shows disabled tools**: Disabled tools now appear with `false` value in Opencode output, providing explicit visibility of all tool states; **Alphabetical tool ordering**: Opencode tools are now sorted alphabetically for deterministic output; Fixed malformed YAML output when Copilot/ClaudeCode agents have only `disallowedTools` with no enabled tools - now correctly omits the tools section instead of outputting `tools: \\n  - `; 4 new unit tests covering harness-specific tool output format scenarios (alphabetical sorting, empty tools, only disallowedTools for Copilot/ClaudeCode); OpenSpec requirement documentation for harness-specific tools output format in `openspec/specs/markdown-writer/spec.md`",
  "repository": "",
